#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/language/copy_op/index.rst:71
msgid ""
"Normally, we require the extents of both sides to be the same. If they "
"differ, the copy instruction follows an internal rule to select one side as "
"the base range and create iteration space. This may generate unexpected "
"code. And if some dimensions are 1, unexpected errors may happen."
